            "desc": "Verify an oracle-signed payment proof.\nChecks (in order):   1. Amount >= MIN_AMOUNT   2. Proof not expired (timestamp within 5 min)   3. oracle_pubkey is a registered oracle   4. Ed25519 signature is valid   5. payment_id not already processed (replay protection)\nOn success: stores payment_id, increments counter, emits ARC-28 event.\nBox references required in the ATC call:   - oracle_pubkey bytes  (oracle registry lookup)   - payment_id bytes     (replay protection write)",
            "events": [
                {
                    "name": "PaymentVerified",
                    "args": [
                        {
